# 注意：combined_refactor/ 下的 index.html、login.html、favicon.png、ca-certificates.crt
# 都是 go:embed 的编译期输入，绝对不能排除，否则 go build 直接失败。

# 版本控制与 CI（不进镜像，也不用参与构建）
.git
.gitignore
.github

# 与镜像无关的产物与素材
app/
release_assets/
build/
bin/
dist/
img/

# 文档与本地环境
AGENTS.md
README.md
.env
.env.*
docker-compose.yml
build-image.sh

# Go 编译产物与运行期缓存（都应在容器内重新生成，避免把本机文件带进镜像）
combined_refactor/cfdata
combined_refactor/cfdata-*
combined_refactor/cfdata-config.json
combined_refactor/cfdata-debug.log
combined_refactor/ips-v4.txt
combined_refactor/ips-v6.txt
combined_refactor/locations.json
combined_refactor/*.mmdb
combined_refactor/*.csv
combined_refactor/*.txt

# 编辑器与系统文件
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*Zone.Identifier*
